WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,010
You will be living in the Hou Mansion these days

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:08,340
Okay, okay, I'm going to sleep first. I'm so sleepy.

3
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:16,100
Song Yu, if it weren’t for you

4
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,880
Maybe I will really be half a year late in being a light-boned coquettish person

5
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,480
Completely cut off the chance of survival

6
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:23,580
You pulled me up again

7
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:35,100
This weather doesn't seem like a good sign

8
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:41,700
Miss, it's snowing. Be careful of getting cold.

9
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:42,900
Where is the Crown Prince?

10
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:45,190
This morning an old friend of the prince’s came to the house.

11
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:47,110
The prince is accompanying you in the study

12
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:49,530
Miss, the eldest lady called the girls in the mansion

13
00:00:49,530 --> 00:00:51,650
Enjoying the snow in Nuange, I asked my wife if she wanted to go.
